<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-26T02:57:34.942Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:57:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces killed eight terrorists in operations in Peshawar and Bannu, while armed men killed a former soldier in Kabul. A drone strike in Mastung killed one civilian and injured two children, and a forest fire in Kunar killed two children and burned over ten jeribs of forest. Residents of Bajaur district died in a shipwreck off Libya, and the closure of the Pakistan border has stalled fish and meat trade in Helmand. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBoLXJTak00WVJ1cFY4Vlljdk9fVDNZcDVEbnkydUxTUE5Lc3JDVm8tTm5rUm0zRUlDWTVBdDVpeVVUZlM4Y0lzZg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPTUtiR05VNU0ySFNXTEtWUTlqU2NSem1BSW9ZM3oxNzBmVFBlaElUUzBHUlA4N19YWTdLRnlMVWExcTRwSmZJa3AzUGdqb25JUXNNUUdfclItWWpFRlVlWXQyeGNhampkOEhZNm5wTF9WZ2h2WENmTnRuM1B6ZFdDWGlwM1A0STAxZWQyc3ZhNE5USFZqUmdqaEUwTi02VU9xUHJsaXpwMm1PUDhvd2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Balochwarna News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOQ2psNzZ2RHJxdk96cjJxUktwTFI5WWlxOEF4dUs5UDZLbmJpUmJmdENaVVZuUHZ5dUo3UmhOdEo2V2tIUnE1UVNsWnQxNjJoQkpyYU0zSjFiMEMzdGZBZzRuWmZFWDJnWHVDOUtteU9vTzBtNTNPQXBwM0gtMUkzVEp4UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQY1RZQlR3TERVUlBYcHpTNGtKdGF1bVplZ3ZWYWhUbW5LeWlmNFR0dlpXUFhoU292M2lKcjV2TktEOUw2azVnRU03UG9td0ZPZ21xaUZJT1NKQjF2WEdJQTU1ZF8xN2dpWFVrWnZpaHpRYmVESzNBWGVjYUhWS3hYbVE0NGNSZ2ZWQlNDTlpXMzl4ZWRMdTB3cDU0amtPT21jRks1YkpR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPRXRNeTBnUnFBbk9pWjFldmRVYXozLUNvSGFnS1lfRjh